# Formal verification tasks for projects/coherent_noc: full proof and covers for xy_router (X-then-Y routing, one-hot output, per-VC credit conservation, VC isolation) and bounded check and covers for d2d_replay (8-slot safety, CRC-16-CCITT integrity, exact Go-Back-N NAK replay).
[tasks]
xy_proof xy prove
xy_reach xy cover
d2d_check d2d bmc
d2d_reach d2d cover

[options]
prove: mode prove
bmc: mode bmc
bmc: depth 30
cover: mode cover
cover: depth 30

[engines]
prove: abc pdr
bmc: abc bmc3
cover: smtbmc yices

[script]
read -formal xy_router.sv d2d_replay.sv noc_rules.sv
xy: prep -top xy_router_rules
d2d: prep -top d2d_replay_rules

[files]
../design/xy_router.sv
../design/d2d_replay.sv
noc_rules.sv
